    track F link F5a2 (HPP-366): RC1 and RC2 of F5b by ROADMAP p.280(v),(g)
    
    RC1 (only under KYTY_FIX_MINIMIZE=1; =0 keeps the old path): Presenter::Present
    records the frame into the screenshot/video ring at most once per call and
    finishes it exactly once if recorded - on success, or right after a failed
    present (the submit was made, the slot gets its tick); the zero-extent drop and
    "retry exhausted" exits leave no ring slot pending without a tick.
    
    RC2: the KYTY_TEST_MINIMIZE stand arms only on a level entry line
    "Level has started: <level>" with a non-blank character after the prefix
    before the end of the line (TestMinimizeIsLevelEntry, header-only
    testMinimizeLine.h); the earlier line with an empty name does not arm.
    
    Gate order clean; shader_cfg_tests 127/1 (B11) at =0 and =1, logs equal to F5a
    up to elapsed_ms; RC2 predicate test 17/17; ring model test (f5a2 56/56, f5a
    reproduces the F5b RC1 reorder). No game run; WIP until F5b2/F5c.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

